{"availability":"available","full":"GyroPalm/ROS-SLAM-Map-Editor","name":"ROS-SLAM-Map-Editor","description":"A web-based map editor for quick editing of ROS and ROS2 SLAM maps","category":"Developer tools","language":"HTML","stars":36,"forks":8,"created":"2025-08-15T05:46:57Z","updated":"2025-08-19T13:01:04Z","license":null,"branch":"main","homepage":"https://gyropalm.github.io/ROS-SLAM-Map-Editor/","topics":["map-editor","robotics","ros","ros2","slam-toolbox"],"demo":"https://gyropalm.github.io/ROS-SLAM-Map-Editor/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T16:44:20.354Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-09T16:44:20.354Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-09T16:44:20.354Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-09T16:44:20.354Z","stars":36,"forks":8}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A web-based map editor for quick editing of ROS and ROS2 SLAM maps","This repository provides a web-based map editor designed specifically for quick and convenient editing of ROS and ROS2 SLAM maps, such as those created in the popular slamtoolbox. As the ROS2 ecosystem never had a native tool for this purpose, a significant gap existed in the workflow of many robotics developers and researchers. Instead of command lines or image editors, this is a hassle-free, open-source tool that enables engineers and researchers to fine-tune their SLAM maps right inside a modern browser, as well as create Keep-out zones using a mask-filter overlay.","The map editor can be thought of as a specialized paint tool, allowing users to effortlessly modify and refine their maps with precision. With this tool, users can add, remove, or modify map features, such as walls, obstacles, and other elements (e.g. furniture changes in a building), to create a more accurate and reliable representation of their environment. This tool helps users achieve what would normally take longer with a 3rd party image editor."],"features":["[x] Completely Browser-based Self-Hosted Solution (superior privacy)","[x] Responsive Map Editing for Touchscreen Devices and Computers","[x] Drag and Drop Map PGM and YAML files","[x] Drag and Drop Keepout PGM and YAML files (suffix as keepout.pgm and keepout.yaml)","[x] Drag and Drop to Load Both File Sets"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/GyroPalm/ROS-SLAM-Map-Editor/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"0d5ffa538d0105b063b8134a9ac21d818d384a33893881054be19d75f138e481","extractedAt":"2026-10-09T16:44:20.453Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T16:44:20.453Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A web-based map editor for quick editing of ROS and ROS2 SLAM maps","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/GyroPalm/ROS-SLAM-Map-Editor/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"0d5ffa538d0105b063b8134a9ac21d818d384a33893881054be19d75f138e481","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/GyroPalm/ROS-SLAM-Map-Editor/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-09T16:44:20.453Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2025-08-19T13:01:04Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/GyroPalm/ROS-SLAM-Map-Editor/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-09T16:44:20.453Z","hash":"0d5ffa538d0105b063b8134a9ac21d818d384a33893881054be19d75f138e481","originalBytes":4734,"storedBytes":4734,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["map","tool","drag","slam","keep-out","maps","ros2","zoom","editor","pgm","button","click","draw","drop","editing","erase","files","rectangle","ros","select","work","yaml","area","both","download","keepout","line","mask","open-source","out","paint","please","point","their","users","using","walls","zones","author","brush","change","choose","collaboration","community","convenient","create","created","distance","features","file","filled","free","gyropalm","hold","image","lee","license","lines","mark","measure","meters","mode","modify","mouse","once","overlay","quick","rectangles","see","shift","size","such","take","un-scan","unknown","wall","web-based","would","accurate","achieve","add"